[lesson]   Solution: - **FIX_PLAN:** Replace the wasteful `AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained` (which OOMs on 52 GB models) with the same config-only metadata path that the `model_free=True` branch already uses. All three needed fields (arch_name, model_type, moe) are available from `AutoConfig`. AutoRound will load the actual weights via `mllm_load_model` (CPU first, block-by-block dispatch on GPU with `low_gpu_mem_usage=True`), which is the same path used successfully for other large models.;- **SMOKE_TEST:** Verify config-only extraction returns same metadata as full-model load would, and that AutoRound's MLLM loader accepts the model string.;;Let me verify the fix works before writing it.;--;
